 <h3><u>mera veer hussain</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><big>haaye haaye<br>armaan reya armaan reya<br>kyun baad hussain ye jahaan reya<br>mazlum da sadqa salle ala<br>imaan reya quraan reya<br><br>armaan reya<br>hay hussain hay hay hussain<br>hussain hay hussain hay hay hussain <br>kar zainab ro ro bain <br>o mera veer hussain hayo mera veer hussain<br><br>teri laash hai jalti reti par <br>dil paata nahi hai chain<br>o mera veer hussain<br>hussain hai hussain hai hai hussain <br><br>ay bhaayi mere bari mehnat se<br>maa zahra ne paala hai tujhe <br>mein dekh nahi sakti bhayya<br>aankhon se lahu tera behte <br>tere khun ke ek ek qatre par<br>qurbaan karun daarain<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>jalti hai zamine karbobala<br>hai chur badan tera zakhmon se<br>naazon ke pale kund khanjar se<br>zaalim ne kiya hai qatl tujhe<br>is zulm pe tarpa to hoga<br>qalbe shaahe qaunain<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>khaime ke dar se maqtal tak<br>sattar qadmon ki duri thi<br>is waaste baahar aa na saki<br>mujhe parde ki majburi thi<br>ummat ne kiya sajde me zibah<br>zahra ka nure ain<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>teri laash ko mein dafna na saki<br>mein tujhko kafan pehna na saki<br>ye dard mujhe tarpaayega<br>mein tera sog mana na saki<br>afsos ke doshe risaalat ka<br>hai khaak pe zeb o zain<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>jo tune kiya tha nana se<br>wo vaada aaj nibhaaya hai<br>sar sajde me katwaaya hai<br>khaaliq ka deen bachaaya hai <br>hai aaj ke baad zamaane me<br>islam tumhaari dain<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>mazlum di pyaasi gardan te<br>jado khanjar shimr chalaaya hai <br>tatheer di vaaris bibi ne<br>quraan te sar te jaaya hai <br>khaime pe dar do kardi rayi<br>fariyaad hussain di behn<br>o mera veer hussain<br><br>hussain hay hussain hay hay hussain <br>kar zainab ro ro bain <br>o mera veer hussain hayo mera veer hussain <br>hussain hay hussain hay hay hussain</big></p> 
